@ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress = http://localhost:5236
@ArrowMediaType = application/vnd.apache.arrow.stream
@ApiKey = dev-secret
@jobName = demo

# Manuel kullanim durumunda fallback degisken (Varsayilan ID)
@jobId = 1

# ==============================================================================
# 1. Create a Job (Job adı zorunludur: /api/arrow/jobs/demo)
# Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client istegi: # @name createJob
# ==============================================================================
# @name createJob
POST {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs/{{jobName}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-Correlation-ID: custom-chain-123

{
  "cnnName": "inmemory",
  "query": "SELECT * FROM People LIMIT @limit",
  "parameters": {
    "limit": 3
  },
  "batchSize": 1
}

### 1b. Create Export Report Job (Stand-alone trigger)
POST {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs/export-report
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
X-Correlation-ID: custom-chain-123

{
  "reportName": "MonthlySummary",
  "sourceJobId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 2. Get Job Status (Sadece GUID ile - Job Name gerektirmez!)
GET {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs/{{createJob.response.body.$.id}}
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 3. Get Job Events (SSE - Sadece GUID ile!)
GET {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs/{{createJob.response.body.$.id}}/events
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 4. Get Job Results (Arrow IPC stream - Sadece GUID ile!)
GET {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs/{{createJob.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: {{ArrowMediaType}}
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 5. Get Job Original Request Configuration
GET {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs/{{createJob.response.body.$.id}}/request
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 6. List Jobs
GET {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs?take=100
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 6b. List Jobs by Correlation ID (Tüm İş Zincirini Sorgula)
GET {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs?correlationId=custom-chain-123
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 7. List Completed Jobs
GET {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs?state=Completed&take=50
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 8. Cancel a Running Job
POST {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs/{{createJob.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 9. Retry a Cancelled/Failed Job
POST {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs/{{jobId}}/retry
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### 10. Delete Job (Sadece GUID ile!)
DELETE {{ArrowHttp_SampleHost_HostAddress}}/api/arrow/jobs/{{createJob.response.body.$.id}}
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
